From af3af720bf1513aee0c240b01cd22aac2c50ca0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Sam (local build)" <sam@local>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 08:56:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/18] V2 board (Pi_Flex_V2) for the DDE emulator: PT-CAN
 capture, MCP251863 RX ONLY

- PICO_FLEXRAY_BOARD_V2 CMake option (default OFF = V1). Board header, MCP251863 driver and
  V2 LED/CAN service taken unchanged from ts-capture (= pico-flexray-v2 v2-hw a1510d0)
- V2: no relays, LEDs GP8/9, CAN on spi0 GP16-21, FR3/FR4 parked on unconnected pins;
  FR1/FR2/BGE/STBN identical to V1, so the emulator TX pins are unchanged
- strictly no CAN TX: MCP251863_RX_ONLY compiles the driver without send functions,
  init refuses anything but Listen Only, #error unless V2_CAN_MODE=LISTEN_ONLY,
  V2_CAN_TEST_TX=0 and classic CAN (no FD)
- CAN frames -> USB CAN records (type 0x43, opt-in vendor 0xa1), SavvyCAN bus 2
- dde_emu.h: f1_b3 holds payload[2]; dde_kl15_reset in RAM
---
